"{0} 不是有效的 JSON：{1}","{0} is still cited in {1}":"{0} 仍被 {1} 引用","{0} is still in the map":"{0} 仍在地圖中","{0} is still missing":"{0} 仍然缺失","{0} is {1}, not an older Reforged this archive knows ({2})":"{0} 是 {1}，不是此封存檔已知的較舊 Reforged 版本（{2}）","{0} is {1}: maps above {2} need more memory than a browser gives a page. Use the program for Windows or Linux (Download on GitHub).":"{0} 為 {1}：超過 {2} 的地圖所需記憶體比瀏覽器分配給單一頁面的還多。請使用 Windows 或 Linux 版程式（在 GitHub 下載）。","{0} is {1}x{2}: the lobby picture must be square with a side that is a power of two from {3} to {4} (the size of the editor's minimap)":"{0} 為 {1}x{2}：大廳圖片必須是正方形，邊長為 2 的次方，範圍從 {3} 到 {4}（編輯器小地圖的大小）","{0} item drop roll(s) found. {1} item(s) in the item tables of the World Editor.":"找到 {0} 次物品掉落抽取。World Editor 物品表中有 {1} 個物品。","{0} item on the ground":"地面上有 {0} 個物品","{0} item type(s) and {1} unit type(s) used as their model an effect or a doodad of the game whose Reforged graphics file has nothing a click can hit (no collision shape, no geoset box: only a drag box selected them there). Their model is now a copy of the classic file, which the click hits in both graphics:":"{0} 種物品類型與 {1} 種單位類型使用遊戲的某個特效或 doodad 作為其模型，而其 Reforged 畫面檔案沒有任何可供點擊命中的部分（沒有碰撞形狀、沒有 geoset 框：在該畫面下只能用拖曳框選取）。它們的模型現在是經典版檔案的副本，在兩種畫面下都能點擊命中：","{0} item types and {1} unit types use as their model an effect or a doodad of the game whose Reforged graphics file has nothing a click can hit (no collision shape, no geoset box): in Reforged graphics they can only be selected with a drag box, while in Classic graphics the click works ({2}). The Doctor's port points them at a copy of the classic file. Models: {3}.":"{0} 種物品類型與 {1} 種單位類型使用遊戲的某個特效或 doodad 作為其模型，而其 Reforged 畫面檔案沒有任何可供點擊命中的部分（沒有碰撞形狀、沒有 geoset 框）：在 Reforged 畫面下，它們只能用拖曳框選取，而在經典畫面下點擊有效（{2}）。Doctor 的移植會將它們指向經典版檔案的副本。模型：{3}。","{0} items got an empty requirement, so a shop on 3.0 no longer asks for a building or tech the map does not have ({1}).":"{0} 個物品已設為空白需求，因此 3.0 中的商店不會再要求地圖中不存在的建築或科技（{1}）。","{0} items inherit a requirement from their base item that the map does not define ({1}), and the 3.0 game data has it where the classic data did not, so a shop asks for a building the map never has (the Orb of Slow: \"requires Castle\"). The Doctor writes an empty requirement.":"{0} 個物品從其基礎物品繼承了地圖並未定義的需求（{1}），而 3.0 遊戲資料有此需求、經典資料卻沒有，因此商店會要求地圖中永遠不會有的建築（緩慢之球：「需要城堡」）。Doctor 會寫入空白需求。","{0} items on the ground":"地面上有 {0} 個物品","{0} kept the name of a global array ({1}): that is how a memory library reads the array's address in the game. In the custom script, which JassHelper compiles again on every save, it is written the way the map was before it was compiled: the typecast declares the local by the name JassHelper renames into the array, and the function that reads the array without an index is marked for pjass (//# +nosemanticerror). war3map.j keeps the compiled code the game runs.":"{0} 保留了全域陣列的名稱({1}):記憶體函式庫在遊戲中就是這樣讀取陣列位址的。自訂腳本每次儲存時 JassHelper 都會重新編譯,其中寫成地圖編譯之前的樣子:typecast 以 JassHelper 會重新命名為該陣列的名稱來宣告區域變數,而不帶索引讀取該陣列的函式則標記給 pjass (//# +nosemanticerror)。war3map.j 保留遊戲執行的已編譯程式碼。","{0} kept the name of a global array ({1}): that is how a memory library reads the array's address in the game. JassHelper may refuse it when you save; renaming it would stop the map in the game.":"{0}沿用了全域陣列的名稱（{1}）：記憶體函式庫正是以此在遊戲中讀取陣列的位址。儲存時 JassHelper 可能會拒絕；但若改名，地圖會在遊戲中停止運作。","{0} lang={1} mode={2} map={3} doctor={4}":"{0} lang={1} mode={2} map={3} doctor={4}","{0} leave(s); the last: {1} at {2} ({3}, {4}).":"{0} 人離開；最後一位：{1}，於 {2}（{3}，{4}）。","{0} leveled field points to another data column on some levels.":"{0} 個分級欄位在某些等級指向另一個資料欄。","{0} leveled fields of the object data point to another data column on some levels: on those levels the field the author meant keeps its base value. The Doctor sets them to the column the other levels use.":"物件資料中有 {0} 個分級欄位在某些等級指向另一個資料欄：在那些等級上，作者原本想用的欄位會維持基礎值。Doctor 會把它們設為其他等級所用的資料欄。","{0} leveled fields point to another data column on some levels.":"{0} 個分級欄位在某些等級指向另一個資料欄。",